[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/856210393","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/6896#issuecomment-856210393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/6896","id":856210393,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1NjIxMDM5Mw==","user":{"login":"hawkinsp","id":348932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-07T19:50:57Z","updated_at":"2021-06-07T19:50:57Z","body":"The `This thread has been waiting for 5000ms for and may be stuck` message means that one of the other participants in `pmap` didn't show up to a collective operation like `psum` after a thread had been waiting for 5s. Now, this is sometimes benign: threads/GPUs are slow sometimes. The part that makes me think it's a real bug is that the GPU utilization then drops to 0 and stays there.\r\n\r\nThe question is: why is one device (presumably device `2`) getting stuck? One way this might happen if some computation before the collective is not terminating. Another way that it might happen is if you put collectives like `psum` in control flow, and not all participants are taking the same branches.\r\n\r\nIf nothing like that rings a bell, I think we'd need a reproduction to make further progress.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/856210393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/866822524","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/6896#issuecomment-866822524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/6896","id":866822524,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2NjgyMjUyNA==","user":{"login":"hawkinsp","id":348932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-23T13:11:12Z","updated_at":"2021-06-23T13:11:12Z","body":"Closing since there's no way we can reproduce the problem. Please feel free to reopen if you have a reproduction we can debug.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/866822524/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laug